<title>HONG KONG: China EB-IHD to start bank stake talks.</title>
<headline>China EB-IHD to start bank stake talks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red chip China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd said it intends to begin negotiations to acquire a 20 percent stake in Everbright Bank of China.</p>
</text>
